      <p>Prefer to give in kind? Donations of food or product are just as welcome — we'll promote you as a headline contributor across our socials and event promotions, exactly as we would a monetary sponsor.</p>
      <p>And whatever you decide, we'd love to see you there. Bring your family and friends and experience Harumatsuri with us this spring. Thank you for your time — we look forward to working together.</p>
